   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1.  A THIN ticket drops the pack under 1024 and caches nothing \u2014 no error, just a 0% hit ratio.\n2.  Setting VERTEX_MODEL_FAST=claude-haiku-4-5 would silently kill caching on every fast-tier\n     call (judge, critique, distill, understanding). A second, independent reason to keep it UNSET\n     \u2014 the live A/B already measured turbo+fast at PQS 0.45 vs 0.75.",
   "originalText": "1.  A THIN ticket drops the pack under 1024 and caches nothing \u2014 no error, just a 0% hit ratio.\n2.  Setting VERTEX_MODEL_FAST=claude-haiku-4-5 would silently kill caching on every fast-tier\n     call (judge, critique, distill, understanding). A second, independent reason to keep it UNSET\n     \u2014 the live A/B already measured turbo+fast at PQS 0.45 vs 0.75.",
